      "q": "How much does TriWest Healthcare Alliance make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "TriWest Healthcare Alliance has $14.5B in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. TriWest Healthcare Alliance holds 25 awards this fiscal year with an average award size of $581M. TriWest Healthcare Alliance obligations are up 8.6% year over year."
